<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-BELGIAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Belgian League Cup</p>
<p>semifinal soccer match played on Saturday:</p>
<p>    Aalst		3    Ekeren	    3</p>
<p>(first leg 0-0. Ekeren qualify for the final on away goals)</p>
